# The package holds the bundle, Paged.js, the page files of @nimblescape/plantuml
# for the PlantUML diagrams of the PDF, the scripts and the style of the pages
# in the Markdown preview and of the view "Front Matter", the built-in layouts,
# the copy of the npm package @nimblescape/markdownpaper in cli/ for the command
# mp in the terminals of VS Code, the icon and the documents only: ignore
# everything, then keep the listed files.
**
!dist/extension.js
!cli/package.json
